{
  "cues": [
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "hook",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 4.531,
      "lines": [
        "Amazon's experimental hiring tool",
        "allegedly ranked women lower."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "hook",
      "start": 4.531,
      "end": 6.76,
      "lines": [
        "Abandoning it took three years."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "problem",
      "start": 7.067,
      "end": 11.881,
      "lines": [
        "Today, no company can afford that",
        "much time, money or possible harm."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "problem",
      "start": 11.881,
      "end": 16.837,
      "lines": [
        "The challenge is to govern AI",
        "responsibly and still create real value."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 17.167,
      "end": 20.274,
      "lines": [
        "In AI Center X,",
        "you start with the AI Canvas:"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 20.274,
      "end": 25.383,
      "lines": [
        "the CV Screening Assistant's problem,",
        "its data, and the people it affects."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f1",
      "scene": "canvas",
      "start": 25.383,
      "end": 27.317,
      "lines": [
        "Then you simulate the risks."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.841,
      "lines": [
        "An AI agent suggests risks, each cited"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 2.841,
      "end": 7.402,
      "lines": [
        "from the MIT AI Risk Repository",
        "and the AI Incident Database."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 7.402,
      "end": 10.617,
      "lines": [
        "You select the relevant",
        "ones and save them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f2",
      "scene": "risks",
      "start": 10.617,
      "end": 12.86,
      "lines": [
        "Now, generate the mitigations."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.888,
      "lines": [
        "For every saved risk,",
        "the agent proposes mitigations,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 3.888,
      "end": 8.509,
      "lines": [
        "each classed by MIT's draft",
        "taxonomy and tied to the EU AI Act."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 8.509,
      "end": 10.489,
      "lines": [
        "Again, you select and save."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f3",
      "scene": "mitigations",
      "start": 10.489,
      "end": 12.91,
      "lines": [
        "Next come the model enhancements."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 3.438,
      "lines": [
        "Finally, the agent shows",
        "how to put those mitigations"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 3.438,
      "end": 6.486,
      "lines": [
        "into effect: fine-tuning",
        "on audited shortlists,"
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 6.486,
      "end": 10.249,
      "lines": [
        "two checking agents, and learning",
        "from recruiter feedback."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f4",
      "scene": "enhancements",
      "start": 10.249,
      "end": 12,
      "lines": [
        "You save the ones you need."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f5",
      "scene": "end",
      "start": 0,
      "end": 2.142,
      "lines": [
        "From idea to governed initiative."
      ]
    },
    {
      "fragment": "f5",
      "scene": "end",
      "start": 2.142,
      "end": 7.27,
      "lines": [
        "AI Center X: making innovation, governance",
        "and change management work together."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
